            "type": "integer",
            "title": "Cache Creation Tokens",
            "default": 0
          }
        },
        "type": "object",
        "title": "TokenUsage",
        "description": "Aggregated LLM token usage for a request (Gemini + Bedrock stages).\n\ncache_read_tokens / cache_creation_tokens surface prompt-caching activity:\nBedrock Converse reports both; Gemini reports cache reads only (implicit\ncaching, no separate creation cost)."
